っておけない性格で、何かと背負い込むクセがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"にっこりさわやか、文武両道、イベント運営から放課後ティータイムまで様になっているが、すべて努力の賜物である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昔から主人公に恋心を抱いていたが、持って生まれた不運体質により告白すら出来ず、いまだ主人公に気づいてもらえない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は生徒会長として生徒の風紀を取り締まる責任があるの！　その私の目の前でコイツ……同じ部屋にその……ひ、一晩……ぁぅぁぅ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42703"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4711","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4711","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4711","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4711","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4711","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d3e0691410974791584fd276a2e3c3be57573573a3ae72e0d19c27197b56402.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/9967d04973d07ba5d81224155617ac05d9b44c6ad70f97f837412af18b8cd19d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:79498:42703:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17955","characterName":"すももちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42705","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"79498"}],"egsCharacterIds":[