りパフパフされたりと、皆のマスコットとして （主に主人公に） セクハラされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都会人ぶろうとするが、感情的になるとつい東北弁が出る。 子供扱いすると怒る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「勝ったら騎士ランク上位入りだと思ったら緊張してしまいました…… うぅ、もしゃもしゃ。スイートポテトおいしいです」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42705"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4712","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4712","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4712","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"80 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4712","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4712","sourceWorkId":"19032","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbc61e2990a118463765afb96aeb26df0e6cf0c9d47ad57ed35bec58bf6c8631.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6ae59278795464ef8930c4942720737820638fead08c054325c3c5d9cf2b7c4d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"真中桂子","creatorId":"vndb:s4378","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4378","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4378","name":"真中 桂子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:79498:42705:5205:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c17956","characterName":"兜 不二子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42707","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"79498"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4713"],"vndbCharacterId":"c17956"},"originalCharacterName":"兜 不二子","characterNameSourc